==Battleground==
*10 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 12~30 seconds<sup>360f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 12~30 seconds<sup>360f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Le'Solar]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 40~66.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 24~36 seconds<sup>720f~1,080f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 18~24 seconds<sup>540f~720f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Midnight Lycopene is the first [[Legend Stages|Legend Stage]] to be balanced around [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 2's [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]]. It can prove to be quite difficult if you only have the [[Treasure]]s from the first [[Cats of the Cosmos]] chapter, but becomes a pushover with maxed Treasures from all three chapters.

The battle plays out as you might expect. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] and [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]] serve as decent [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critical Hitters]], [[Loincloth Cat]], [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kendo Cat]], and especially [[Major Leaguer Cat]] are good [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]], tanks or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellites]] serve as meatshields, and a long-ranged heavy hitter such as a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] can be used to take down the Le'Solars.

==Trivia==
*Lycopene is the chemical in tomatoes that makes them red. Thus, [[Lycopene Sunset]] might refer to a reddish-colored sunset, and Midnight Lycopene might refer to a later point in time. Alternatively, there is a darker-colored tomato called a Midnight Tomato, but this doesn't appear to be the best explanation.
*Midnight Lycopene may have been designed specifically to be cleared using [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Marine Cat]], who was added in the [[Version 7.3 Update|previous update]] and has both [[Critical Hit]] and Barrier Breaker abilities.

